; mandelbrot.uft — counts bounded points in the mandelbrot set
; Uses a float array for inner-loop state to avoid pass-through accumulation
; in inlined while bodies (vset has no pass-through, unlike local !).
entry
1000 n!
hasargs 'setn if
5 _arr float st!
0 count!
n@ 'ybody for
count@ "%d" fmt print
ret

ybody:
k!
st@ 3 2.0 k@ * n@ div 1.0 - vset
n@ 'xbody for
ret

xbody:
k!
st@ 2 2.0 k@ * n@ div 1.5 - vset
st@ 0 0.0 vset
st@ 1 0.0 vset
0 i!
'icond 'ibody while
st@ 0 vget st@ 0 vget * st@ 1 vget st@ 1 vget * + 4.0 gt not count@ + count!
ret

icond:
i@ 50 lt st@ 0 vget st@ 0 vget * st@ 1 vget st@ 1 vget * + 4.0 gt not and ret

ibody:
st@ 4 st@ 0 vget st@ 0 vget * st@ 1 vget st@ 1 vget * - st@ 2 vget + vset
st@ 1 st@ 0 vget st@ 1 vget 2.0 * * st@ 3 vget + vset
st@ 0 st@ 4 vget vset
i@ inc i!
0 ret

setn:
1 argi n!
0 ret
